      "statement": "The Payments ARB operates alongside distinct PTT governance forums with differing cadences and lead times: the Payments Platform Demand Board (monthly, prioritizes PPH roadmap), FCT Change Advisory (bi-weekly, 5 business days, FCC sign-off for hold/screening changes, year-end freeze Dec-15 to Jan-05), Disclosure Review Committee (bi-weekly Thursday, 5 business days), MRM Model Inventory & Validation (continuous, register before development, Tier 2 validation 10-14 weeks plus queue), and Privacy Impact Assessment (continuous, ~4 weeks, required for new client-data uses in client-facing features).",
